"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">Tapez vosse no d' uzeu Si "
"sovni do laecea chal. Si vos n' avoz pont d' conte, vizitez <a href=\"http://"
"www.rememberthemilk.com/signup/\"><span style=\" text-decoration: underline; "
"color:#0000ff;\">http://www.rememberthemilk.com/signup/</span></a> po nd "
"ahiver onk.</p></body></html>"

